    "sourceWikitext": "{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Cookie recipes\n| Yield = 40 cookies\n| Servings = \n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n'''Alfajores''' are a Latin-American sandwich [[Cookbook:Cookie|cookie]] filled with [[Cookbook:Dulce de Leche|dulce de leche]].\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (120 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]]) [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n* 1 cup (240 ml) white granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n* 2 egg [[Cookbook:Egg Yolk|yolks]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Vanilla|vanilla]]\n* 2 tsp [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]] rind, grated\n* 1½ cup (360 ml) [[Cookbook:Cornstarch|cornstarch]]\n* ½ cup (120 ml) [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n* ¼ tsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Dulce de Leche|Dulce de leche]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# [[Cookbook:Cream|Cream]] butter; add sugar and beat until fluffy.\n# Add egg and egg yolks one at a time, beating well. Beat in vanilla and lemon rind.\n# Sift together cornstarch, flour, baking powder, and salt. Add to batter and mix well.\n# Drop batter by small spoonfuls onto well-buttered [[Cookbook:Baking Sheet|baking sheet]].\n# Bake at 350°F for 15 minutes. Remove immediately and cool.\n# Sandwich the cookies together with dulce de leche.\n\n[[Category:Argentine recipes|Argentine recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes for cookies]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon zest]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornstarch]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dulce de leche]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]",
    "isRecipe": true,
